{
  "converter_version": "csv-1.0.0",
  "note": "How CSV telemetry is converted into an ARJUNA v1.1 ULog before analysis. A known format maps every column exactly; any other CSV is mapped by column name ('generic'), with every unit or frame assumption written into the conversion report. Columns that cannot be mapped are dropped and listed, never guessed.",
  "formats": [
    {
      "id": "uav_flt_csv",
      "label": "FLT single-file telemetry (33 columns, 50 Hz)",
      "required": ["t_ms", "phi_deg", "theta_deg", "ax", "ay", "az", "gx", "gy", "gz"],
      "aliases": {"t_ms": ["time_ms", "timestamp_ms"], "phi_deg": ["roll_deg"], "theta_deg": ["pitch_deg"], "z_est": ["alt_est"],
                  "z_set": ["alt_set", "alt_setpoint"], "tof_h": ["tof_height"], "rc_thr": ["throttle_cmd"]},
      "basis": "Owner-provided column dictionary (2026-11-15) plus repository data checks: accelerometer m/s^2 (|a| = 9.80-9.82 at rest), angles in degrees, time in ms with gyro in deg/s (d(roll)/dt matches gx).",
      "time": {"column": "t_ms", "unit": "ms"},
      "min_airborne_s": 1.0,
      "min_alt_range_m": 0.2,
      "min_airborne_basis": "FLT recordings are short test hops (about 0.5 m, 1-3 s airborne); the approved 10 s minimum is for full flights. Chosen by the owner on 2026-11-17.",
      "motor_layout": "unknown",
      "air": {"armed": "armed", "height": ["tof_h", "z_est"], "height_threshold_m": 0.10},
      "rc_map": {"ROLL": 1, "PITCH": 2, "THROTTLE": 3, "YAW": 4},
      "fields": [
        {"from": "phi_deg", "to": "arjuna_attitude.roll", "unit": "deg"},
        {"from": "theta_deg", "to": "arjuna_attitude.pitch", "unit": "deg"},
        {"from": "gx", "to": ["arjuna_imu.gyro[0]", "arjuna_attitude.rates[0]"], "unit": "deg/s"},
        {"from": "gy", "to": ["arjuna_imu.gyro[1]", "arjuna_attitude.rates[1]"], "unit": "deg/s"},
        {"from": "gz", "to": ["arjuna_imu.gyro[2]", "arjuna_attitude.rates[2]"], "unit": "deg/s"},
        {"from": "ax", "to": "arjuna_imu.accel[0]", "unit": "m/s^2"},
        {"from": "ay", "to": "arjuna_imu.accel[1]", "unit": "m/s^2"},
        {"from": "az", "to": "arjuna_imu.accel[2]", "unit": "m/s^2"},
        {"from": "m1", "to": "motor", "index": 0, "unit": "pwm_us"},
        {"from": "m2", "to": "motor", "index": 1, "unit": "pwm_us"},
        {"from": "m3", "to": "motor", "index": 2, "unit": "pwm_us"},
        {"from": "m4", "to": "motor", "index": 3, "unit": "pwm_us"},
        {"from": "rc_roll", "to": "arjuna_rc_input.channels[0]", "unit": "raw"},
        {"from": "rc_pitch", "to": "arjuna_rc_input.channels[1]", "unit": "raw"},
        {"from": "rc_thr", "to": "arjuna_rc_input.channels[2]", "unit": "raw"},
        {"from": "rc_yaw", "to": "arjuna_rc_input.channels[3]", "unit": "raw"},
        {"from": "rc_fs", "to": "arjuna_rc_input.failsafe", "unit": "flag"},
        {"from": "armed", "to": "arjuna_vehicle_status.armed", "unit": "flag"},
        {"from": "z_est", "to": "arjuna_position.pos_u", "unit": "m"},
        {"from": "z_set", "to": "arjuna_setpoints.alt_sp", "unit": "m"},
        {"from": "tof_h", "to": "arjuna_rangefinder.distance", "unit": "m"},
        {"from": "tof_mm", "to": "arjuna_rangefinder.distance_raw", "unit": "mm"},
        {"from": "tof_ok", "to": "arjuna_rangefinder.valid", "unit": "flag"}
      ],
      "dropped": {
        "u1_core": "controller term; meaning not documented",
        "u1_cmd": "controller term; meaning not documented",
        "u2": "controller term; meaning not documented",
        "u3": "controller term; meaning not documented",
        "u4": "controller term; meaning not documented",
        "kill": "status value (9, 11, 26 seen); encoding not documented",
        "blk": "status flag; encoding not documented",
        "tof_st": "range-sensor status; encoding not documented",
        "aux1": "auxiliary channel; meaning not documented"
      },
      "assumptions": [
        "Axis and sign conventions are assumed to match ARJUNA FLU (x forward, y left, z up; positive pitch = nose down). The accelerometer reads +9.8 m/s^2 on z at rest, which fits FLU, but the roll and pitch signs are not independently verified.",
        "Motor outputs m1-m4 are treated as PWM-like values from 1000 (idle) to 2000 (full), so motor_cmd = (m - 1000) / 1000. Which corner each motor sits on is not known, so motors are named m1-m4 and no position-based conclusion is drawn.",
        "In the air = armed and range-finder height (tof_h, else z_est) above 0.10 m; landed_state is derived this way because the CSV has no landed-state column.",
        "Height columns are taken as metres (tof_h follows (tof_mm - offset) / 1000)."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "generic": {
    "time": ["time_us", "timeus", "timestamp_us", "t_us", "time_ms", "t_ms", "timestamp_ms", "time_s", "t_s", "time", "timestamp", "t"],
    "fields": [
      {"to": "arjuna_attitude.roll", "names": ["roll", "roll_deg", "roll_rad", "phi", "phi_deg", "phi_rad"], "kind": "angle"},
      {"to": "arjuna_attitude.pitch", "names": ["pitch", "pitch_deg", "pitch_rad", "theta", "theta_deg", "theta_rad"], "kind": "angle"},
      {"to": "arjuna_attitude.yaw", "names": ["yaw", "yaw_deg", "yaw_rad", "psi", "psi_deg", "heading", "heading_deg"], "kind": "angle"},
      {"to": ["arjuna_imu.gyro[0]", "arjuna_attitude.rates[0]"], "names": ["gx", "gyro_x", "gyrx", "gyrox", "p", "roll_rate"], "kind": "rate"},
      {"to": ["arjuna_imu.gyro[1]", "arjuna_attitude.rates[1]"], "names": ["gy", "gyro_y", "gyry", "gyroy", "q", "pitch_rate"], "kind": "rate"},
      {"to": ["arjuna_imu.gyro[2]", "arjuna_attitude.rates[2]"], "names": ["gz", "gyro_z", "gyrz", "gyroz", "r", "yaw_rate"], "kind": "rate"},
      {"to": "arjuna_imu.accel[0]", "names": ["ax", "acc_x", "accx", "accel_x"], "kind": "accel"},
      {"to": "arjuna_imu.accel[1]", "names": ["ay", "acc_y", "accy", "accel_y"], "kind": "accel"},
      {"to": "arjuna_imu.accel[2]", "names": ["az", "acc_z", "accz", "accel_z"], "kind": "accel"},
      {"to": "motor", "names": ["m{n}", "motor{n}", "motor_{n}", "rcout{n}", "c{n}", "esc{n}", "pwm{n}"], "kind": "motor"},
      {"to": "arjuna_battery.voltage", "names": ["voltage", "volt", "vbat", "batt_v", "battery_voltage", "volt_v"], "kind": "volt"},
      {"to": "arjuna_battery.current", "names": ["current", "curr", "batt_a", "battery_current", "curr_a"], "kind": "amp"},
      {"to": "arjuna_baro.altitude", "names": ["baro_alt", "alt", "altitude", "alt_m", "baro_altitude"], "kind": "length"},
      {"to": "arjuna_position.pos_u", "names": ["z_est", "alt_est", "height", "pos_u", "z"], "kind": "length"},
      {"to": "arjuna_rangefinder.distance", "names": ["tof_h", "range", "rangefinder", "lidar", "sonar", "dist", "distance"], "kind": "length"},
      {"to": "arjuna_gps.satellites", "names": ["sats", "nsats", "numsat", "satellites"], "kind": "count"},
      {"to": "arjuna_gps.h_acc", "names": ["hacc", "h_acc", "eph"], "kind": "length"},
      {"to": "arjuna_vibration.accel_vibe[0]", "names": ["vibe_x", "vibex"], "kind": "accel_abs"},
      {"to": "arjuna_vibration.accel_vibe[1]", "names": ["vibe_y", "vibey"], "kind": "accel_abs"},
      {"to": "arjuna_vibration.accel_vibe[2]", "names": ["vibe_z", "vibez"], "kind": "accel_abs"},
      {"to": "arjuna_vibration.clip_rate", "names": ["clip", "clips", "clip_rate"], "kind": "count"},
      {"to": "arjuna_vehicle_status.armed", "names": ["armed", "arm", "is_armed"], "kind": "flag"},
      {"to": "arjuna_rc_input.channels[0]", "names": ["rc_roll", "roll_cmd", "rc1"], "kind": "raw"},
      {"to": "arjuna_rc_input.channels[1]", "names": ["rc_pitch", "pitch_cmd", "rc2"], "kind": "raw"},
      {"to": "arjuna_rc_input.channels[2]", "names": ["rc_thr", "throttle", "throttle_cmd", "rc3"], "kind": "raw"},
      {"to": "arjuna_rc_input.channels[3]", "names": ["rc_yaw", "yaw_cmd", "rc4"], "kind": "raw"}
    ],
    "min_airborne_s": 10.0,
    "min_alt_range_m": 2.0,
    "motor_layout": "unknown",
    "air": {"armed": "arjuna_vehicle_status.armed", "height_threshold_m": 0.30, "motor_threshold": 0.15}
  }
}
